    "Old test source was extracted with git show and compiled only in isolated child memory. Four 5-test suites establish ordinary and actual GetShortPathNameW alias before/after behavior without modifying the candidate. The old-alias failure was the manifest assertion, not alias setup or tool failure.",
    "Repair stays in canonical test ownership, introduces no wrapper or additional persistent test, and reuses fixture normalization. Authoring scope and fixed-package separation are preserved."
  ],
